// Feats: milestones one life earns. The union a lineage has ever earned is its
// meta-progression: it unlocks clutch size and wild mutation (unlocksFor), and
// a gene whose featGate names a feat expresses only once the lineage has it.
// Adding a feat = one row + one predicate feat_<name> in src/lineage.cpp.
// Bits are stable.
//
// BLORB_FEAT(bit, name)
BLORB_FEAT(0, reached_adult)
BLORB_FEAT(1, reached_elder)
BLORB_FEAT(2, lived_a_week)
BLORB_FEAT(3, well_fed)
BLORB_FEAT(4, dreamer)
BLORB_FEAT(5, fifth_generation)
